Description: All your laptop battery information in one place, for GNOME
 Battery Health Center shows everything about your laptop battery in one GNOME
 app: health and cycle count, charge limits and profiles to reduce wear, a
 charging schedule and optimized charging, battery use during sleep, power modes
 and power-saving settings, battery-saving tips, and which apps use the most
 energy (with an hour-by-hour view per app). History can be exported as CSV. It
 is available in English, Spanish and German.
 .
 Charge limits need a laptop whose firmware exposes charge thresholds to the
 kernel (as on ThinkPads and many others). Changing them asks for your password
 through PolicyKit; the charging schedule is then carried out by a small root
 service without asking again.

